---
// Developer cards ported from the legacy gh-pages developer section
// (task 21). The legacy avatar image was served from a remote avatar proxy;
// img-src 'self' forbids that, so the X brand mark is rendered directly as
// the avatar (the old site's fallback path, upgraded to the real logo).
---

<div class="card-grid">
  <a class="dev-card" href="https://x.com/i/user/1666355162167021568" rel="noopener" target="_blank" data-testid="dev-x-link">
    <span class="dev-card-avatar dev-card-avatar-fallback" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" focusable="false">
        <path d="M18.244 2 H21.5 l-7.5 8.57 L23 22 h-6.828 l-5.347 -7.006 L4.7 22 H1.443 l8.04 -9.19 L1 2 h6.99 l4.83 6.39 L18.244 2 z" fill="currentColor"></path>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <span class="dev-card-body">
      <span class="dev-card-eyebrow">X (旧 Twitter)</span>
      <span class="dev-card-name">SAS新聞・サス</span>
      <span class="dev-card-desc">開発の近況や日常を投稿しています。フォローやDMもお気軽にどうぞ。</span>
    </span>
    <span class="dev-card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
  </a>

  <a class="dev-card" href="https://sasnews.dev" rel="noopener" target="_blank" data-testid="dev-site-link">
    <span class="dev-card-avatar dev-card-avatar-fallback" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M0 0h48v48H0z" fill="none"></path>
        <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
          <path stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 24a21 21 0 1 0 42 0a21 21 0 1 0-42 0"></path>
          <path stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 24a9 21 0 1 1 18 0a9 21 0 1 1-18 0"></path>
          <path stroke-linecap="round" d="M4.5 31h39m-39-14h39"></path>
        </g>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <span class="dev-card-body">
      <span class="dev-card-eyebrow">Developer Site</span>
      <span class="dev-card-name">SAS新聞 | Official Site</span>
      <span class="dev-card-desc">開発者のポートフォリオサイト。他の作品やプロフィールはこちらから。</span>
    </span>
    <span class="dev-card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
  </a>
</div>

<style>
  .dev-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    min-width: 0;
    padding: var(--space-5);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      border-color var(--motion-base),
      background-color var(--motion-base),
      transform var(--motion-base);
  }

  .dev-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-success);
    background: var(--color-surface-raised);
    transform: translateY(-0.125rem);
  }

  .dev-card-avatar {
    display: flex;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 3.5rem;
    height: 3.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: var(--color-surface-raised);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--color-line);
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .dev-card-avatar-fallback {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .dev-card-body {
    display: grid;
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .dev-card-eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
    color: var(--color-subtle);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .dev-card-name {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .dev-card-desc {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }

  .dev-card-arrow {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    color: var(--color-subtle);
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    transition:
      color var(--motion-fast),
      transform var(--motion-fast);
  }

  .dev-card:hover .dev-card-arrow {
    color: var(--color-success);
    transform: translateX(0.125rem);
  }
</style>
